-怎么样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:01:46.731 --> 00:01:50.151 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:06.352 --> 00:03:11.065 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
