58
00:04:32.689 --> 00:04:35.149 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你心情很好呢 薰女…</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:37.026 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心？</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:04:38.278 --> 00:04:39.112 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:04:41.698 --> 00:04:43.908 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>再说一遍！</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
