68
00:05:00.425 --> 00:05:01.384 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>冷静</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:03.469 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
