<c.simplifiedchinese>要上前阻止吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:06:12.538 --> 00:06:15.792 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他想打 还是别阻止了</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
