93
00:06:22.507 --> 00:06:24.342 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>臭小子！接招！</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:06:26.719 --> 00:06:28.846 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>胆小鬼！他藏了把寸铁！</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
