100
00:06:44.362 --> 00:06:46.989 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>用了寸铁也还就这点能耐吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:06:47.073 --> 00:06:48.574 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:06:48.658 --> 00:06:49.867 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂…</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:06:50.576 --> 00:06:52.787 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
