107
00:07:07.426 --> 00:07:10.763 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>为自由而战更难！</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:07:10.847 --> 00:07:13.224 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
