<c.simplifiedchinese>我用一根手指就可以拿下你</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:07:19.272 --> 00:07:21.983 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要小瞧我 接招！</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:07:30.324 --> 00:07:32.660 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>又打了一场无聊的架</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:07:33.453 --> 00:07:35.121 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一弹就…</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:07:35.204 --> 00:07:37.832 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-什…什么…
-该死！</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:07:37.915 --> 00:07:41.586 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喝醉酒惹是生非 在下可以视而不见</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:07:42.295 --> 00:07:46.466 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但你想拔剑的话
在下的耐心就到头了</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:07:47.884 --> 00:07:50.303 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>自由民权运动确实是伟大的事业</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:07:51.053 --> 00:07:57.685 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但改进政府前 得先改进一下自己</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:07:58.769 --> 00:08:00.938 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>快结账回家</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:08:05.276 --> 00:08:08.821 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>非常感谢你的帮助</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:08:08.905 --> 00:08:11.449 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没什么 这架是我自愿打的</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:08:11.532 --> 00:08:13.284 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不用谢我</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:08:13.868 --> 00:08:17.246 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>嘿 剑客 你的脑袋还好吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:08:18.372 --> 00:08:20.625 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事 不要紧</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:08:20.708 --> 00:08:22.168 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:08:22.251 --> 00:08:25.838 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>故意被打伤的话就太惨了</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:08:27.673 --> 00:08:32.887 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>闪开瓶子的话
瓶子可能就砸到那个女孩脸上了</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:08:33.471 --> 00:08:36.807 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以你没动
而是用头挡住了 对吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:08:37.517 --> 00:08:39.685 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>太抬举在下了</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:08:39.769 --> 00:08:41.270 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>谦虚？</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:08:41.354 --> 00:08:45.024 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我喜欢你 打一架怎么样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:08:45.608 --> 00:08:47.235 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢你 但还是算了</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:08:47.318 --> 00:08:48.736 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:08:49.612 --> 00:08:52.073 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>改变主意时告诉我</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:08:52.156 --> 00:08:55.243 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我住在小镇郊区的流氓宿舍</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:08:55.326 --> 00:08:56.536 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>回见</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:08:57.578 --> 00:09:01.374 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（恶）</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:09:01.457 --> 00:09:03.167 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么情况？</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:09:03.251 --> 00:09:05.920 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是好人还是坏人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:09:06.003 --> 00:09:08.756 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>品味方面很糟就是了</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:09:09.882 --> 00:09:11.884 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是个奇怪的男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:09:11.968 --> 00:09:15.221 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-对了！
-你认识他吗 妙小姐？</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:09:15.888 --> 00:09:18.724 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他没结账就走了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:09:24.146 --> 00:09:27.567 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你想让我灭了他？</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:09:27.650 --> 00:09:31.279 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对 我觉得你能做到</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:09:31.362 --> 00:09:34.407 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要说得我像刺客一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:37.493 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我只在乎能不能打一场漂亮的架</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:09:40.413 --> 00:09:43.874 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但你们是怎么越狱的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:09:43.958 --> 00:09:47.295 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>正好说明我们的不满</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:09:47.378 --> 00:09:51.257 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要不是他出现 一切都会顺利进行…</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:09:51.340 --> 00:09:54.010 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真没用</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:09:54.594 --> 00:09:57.680 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个叫剑心的家伙 他厉害吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:09:59.724 --> 00:10:01.892 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我最近打过的架都好无聊</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:10:01.976 --> 00:10:03.978 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-有点厌烦了
-他很厉害！</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:10:05.021 --> 00:10:08.566 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他一拳就把我打倒了</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:10:08.649 --> 00:10:09.734 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>笨蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:10:09.817 --> 00:10:14.030 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你死一千次也证明不了他厉害！</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:18.701 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>请听我说…</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:10:20.036 --> 00:10:23.122 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个叫剑心的家伙真的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:10:25.833 --> 00:10:27.209 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:10:27.293 --> 00:10:29.712 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩左先生 怎么样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:10:29.795 --> 00:10:33.799 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我觉得他是值得打一架的对手</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:10:34.634 --> 00:10:35.468 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:40.181 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>甚至可以用它 我都好几年没用过了</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:10:40.806 --> 00:10:44.185 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>传奇的刽子手 绯村拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:10:44.935 --> 00:10:49.940 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>街头打手斩左
一直想找一个你这样的对手打一架！</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:10:54.654 --> 00:10:58.366 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>传奇的刽子手 绯村拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:10:58.449 --> 00:11:03.996 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>街头打手斩左
一直想找一个你这样的对手打一架！</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:07.083 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他说完那句话后已经离开两周了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:11:07.166 --> 00:11:09.460 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那狂妄自大的人去哪了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:11:10.127 --> 00:11:13.339 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不敢相信他会吓得跑掉了</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:11:13.422 --> 00:11:18.010 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他明明说：“我期待那场架”</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:11:18.719 --> 00:11:20.054 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>笨蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:11:21.097 --> 00:11:23.057 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你才是笨蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:11:23.140 --> 00:11:26.560 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>再模仿我 我就把你倒挂起来！</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:11:26.644 --> 00:11:30.523 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩…斩左先生 您去哪里了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:11:30.606 --> 00:11:32.608 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>打架</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:11:32.691 --> 00:11:35.611 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-另一场吗？
-不是 笨蛋</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:11:36.195 --> 00:11:39.782 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>打架不是从拳打脚踢开始的</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:11:39.865 --> 00:11:43.202 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但就算我和你解释 你们也听不懂</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:11:46.539 --> 00:11:48.457 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>街头打手斩左</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:11:49.083 --> 00:11:53.712 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是享誉东京东部黑社会的职业打手</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:11:53.796 --> 00:11:55.798 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一匹粗鲁的孤狼</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:11:55.881 --> 00:12:00.136 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>根据自己有多享受打架来决定收费</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:12:00.219 --> 00:12:01.929 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但他很厉害！</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:12:02.012 --> 00:12:04.598 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>据说那些和他战斗过的人都倍受惊吓</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:12:04.682 --> 00:12:08.561 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>会连做几个月的噩梦
梦里看到“恶”这个字</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:12:09.186 --> 00:12:14.400 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>利用他的话
我们肯定能处理掉那个讨厌的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:12:14.483 --> 00:12:17.778 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:12:20.489 --> 00:12:21.574 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有客人来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:12:22.616 --> 00:12:25.661 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下 剑心 怎么了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:12:26.412 --> 00:12:27.913 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下感受到他的气了</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:12:29.248 --> 00:12:33.836 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这种傻里傻气
直截了当的斗志是藏不住的</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:38.174 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是来打架的</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:12:38.257 --> 00:12:39.967 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是之前那个家伙</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:12:40.050 --> 00:12:41.510 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下就猜是你</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:12:42.219 --> 00:12:45.097 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>和你说了 在下不想打</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:12:45.681 --> 00:12:47.099 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>无法接受这个回答</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:12:47.183 --> 00:12:49.768 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是作为职业打手来的 不能反悔</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:12:49.852 --> 00:12:54.482 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>尤其是我的目标是爱国者绯村拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:12:57.776 --> 00:13:01.864 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>长州藩出身的维新志士 绯村拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:13:01.947 --> 00:13:05.284 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>习得古流剑术飞天御剑流</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:13:05.367 --> 00:13:08.996 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>14岁至19岁期间活跃于世间</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:13:09.079 --> 00:13:11.415 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一开始是一位杀手</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:13:11.499 --> 00:13:14.126 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>潜伏在黑暗中的冷血暗杀手</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:13:14.210 --> 00:13:20.758 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>后来 捍卫幕府首领麾下
如新选组等革命剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:13:21.467 --> 00:13:25.554 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就这样
这位本应不为人知的杀手声名鹊起</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:13:25.638 --> 00:13:30.392 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在关键的戊辰战争中</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:13:30.476 --> 00:13:34.813 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>第一战鸟羽伏见之战后
销声匿迹作为浪客绯村剑心生活</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:13:35.397 --> 00:13:39.652 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真正的战斗始于了解敌人后</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:13:39.735 --> 00:13:42.530 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>选择正确的作战方式</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:13:42.613 --> 00:13:45.241 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我去幕末杀戮的中心京都
查清了这一切</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:13:46.367 --> 00:13:49.370 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你决定好要和在下打了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:13:49.453 --> 00:13:51.372 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这才是问题所在！</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:13:52.248 --> 00:13:54.708 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我调查后 只发现一些
关于你职业生涯的模糊描述</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:13:54.792 --> 00:13:58.671 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>完全没有飞天御剑流相关的描述</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:13:58.754 --> 00:14:02.675 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>以及为什么冷血的刽子手
变成温柔的浪客了</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:14:02.758 --> 00:14:05.302 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我还没想明白</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:10.933 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以我只想在公平的战斗中
与你正面交锋</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:18.482 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哥 你觉得这个斩左真的能赢吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:14:19.441 --> 00:14:21.402 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的对手是拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:14:21.485 --> 00:14:22.903 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>胜负已定</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:14:22.987 --> 00:14:26.866 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-什么意思？
-别怕</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:14:26.949 --> 00:14:32.121 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>尽管斩左会输
但他还是非常厉害的打手</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:14:32.204 --> 00:14:36.458 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>即使他会战死 但还是会用心作战
拔刀斋很可能会负伤</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:14:37.084 --> 00:14:42.381 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>战斗结束
他一放松警惕 我就去解决他</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:14:42.464 --> 00:14:45.843 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>用我在横滨市买的这个！</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:14:47.303 --> 00:14:49.305 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-在下也不明白
-什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:14:49.388 --> 00:14:52.933 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下见你讨厌欺负弱者的行为</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:14:53.017 --> 00:14:56.896 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么又以街头打手谋生呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:14:56.979 --> 00:15:01.859 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么身后穿着“恶”字呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:15:01.942 --> 00:15:07.448 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的灵魂是正直的
但现在你却非常别扭</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:15:07.531 --> 00:15:11.577 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是什么把你变成这样的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:12.912 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你问的是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:19.001 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:15:19.960 --> 00:15:23.464 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的想知道的话就打赢我吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:15:23.547 --> 00:15:26.467 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我要说一句</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:29.345 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我讨厌维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:15:29.428 --> 00:15:32.932 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们都是伪君子</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:15:33.015 --> 00:15:36.268 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们顶着正义的头衔为所欲为</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:15:36.352 --> 00:15:41.899 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>除掉挡道的人 即使不得不歪曲事实</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:15:41.982 --> 00:15:46.028 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>说什么四民平等
这种漂亮话都是谎言！</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:15:46.111 --> 00:15:50.741 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以我想全心全意地灭了你</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:15:50.824 --> 00:15:53.953 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>传说中最厉害的维新志士刽子手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:16:00.584 --> 00:16:02.962 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>明白了 在下接受你的挑战</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:16:03.045 --> 00:16:04.171 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:06.840 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但先回答在下一个问题</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:16:07.549 --> 00:16:11.136 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是比留间兄弟雇你来的吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:16:11.220 --> 00:16:14.431 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对 你怎么知道？</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:16:14.515 --> 00:16:19.186 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这城里没多少人知道在下的过往</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:16:19.269 --> 00:16:24.775 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且栅栏后面传来肮脏的杀气</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:16:24.858 --> 00:16:26.819 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>出来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:16:26.902 --> 00:16:30.030 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你真的是厉害的剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:16:30.114 --> 00:16:32.700 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 你俩出来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:16:34.076 --> 00:16:36.412 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们说了 快出来</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:45.921 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:16:46.005 --> 00:16:48.465 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-交出来吧
-什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:16:48.549 --> 00:16:50.551 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别“什么”！</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:16:51.635 --> 00:16:52.886 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>果然</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:16:53.637 --> 00:16:57.266 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我知道你这种混蛋想干什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:16:57.349 --> 00:16:58.851 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>听着</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:16:58.934 --> 00:17:04.231 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你雇我来打这场架
但付钱后 这场架就是我的了</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:17:04.314 --> 00:17:05.899 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>任何这样的破小动作…</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:17:08.736 --> 00:17:10.904 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>绝不允许出现</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:17:12.448 --> 00:17:13.615 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喜兵卫…</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:17:16.076 --> 00:17:20.247 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这块地是我的 丫头！</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:17:26.003 --> 00:17:29.631 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>道场有点小</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:17:29.715 --> 00:17:31.383 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们去河边解决吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:17:42.770 --> 00:17:44.563 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>天 他太显眼了</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:17:44.646 --> 00:17:46.106 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-弥彦
-嗯？</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:49.318 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…被吓到了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:17:49.401 --> 00:17:51.111 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有点</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:17:51.195 --> 00:17:52.780 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但不是特别怕</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:17:52.863 --> 00:17:54.698 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算你是刽子手 我也不怕你</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:17:54.782 --> 00:17:59.161 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不如说 知道你为什么
像恶魔那么厉害后</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:17:59.244 --> 00:18:01.330 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有点欣慰</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:18:03.123 --> 00:18:05.250 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别说我了 你还好吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:18:05.334 --> 00:18:06.543 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:18:06.627 --> 00:18:08.295 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>“哦啰”什么啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:18:08.378 --> 00:18:10.339 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看那个</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:18:10.422 --> 00:18:12.925 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看那样子 那应该是矛</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:18:13.008 --> 00:18:18.055 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>据说矛对剑的话 他会比你厉害三倍</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:18:18.138 --> 00:18:19.890 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是矛 孩子</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:18:19.973 --> 00:18:22.810 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是比矛更厉害的武器</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:18:24.937 --> 00:18:28.315 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对了 让我做下自我介绍</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:18:32.027 --> 00:18:34.780 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的名字是相乐左之助</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:18:34.863 --> 00:18:37.908 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>黑帮里人称斩左</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:18:37.991 --> 00:18:40.244 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>持斩马刀的左之助</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:18:40.327 --> 00:18:42.246 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>简称斩左</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:18:42.329 --> 00:18:43.455 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩马刀！</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:18:44.873 --> 00:18:46.583 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩马刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:18:46.667 --> 00:18:52.881 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>战国时代前发明的巨型刀
用于一刀拿下骑手及马</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:18:52.965 --> 00:18:54.424 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是迄今最重的刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:18:54.508 --> 00:18:58.387 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>据说因为它太重了
未曾有人能完美驾驭</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:18:58.470 --> 00:19:01.098 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我听说过</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:19:01.181 --> 00:19:03.225 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩左的“最佳拍档”</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:19:03.308 --> 00:19:06.270 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是应仁之乱时的古老兵器
所以形态不是那么完美了</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:19:06.353 --> 00:19:08.230 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然是把刀 但根本没有刀刃</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:19:08.897 --> 00:19:12.401 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我可以用它来粉身碎骨</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:19:13.026 --> 00:19:14.945 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>浪客绯村剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:19:15.779 --> 00:19:17.364 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>持逆刃刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:19:17.447 --> 00:19:19.908 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但可能已经不是什么新鲜事了</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:19:20.701 --> 00:19:22.578 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为你做了调查了</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:19:23.287 --> 00:19:26.540 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对 给你条建议吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:19:27.166 --> 00:19:30.586 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别想着可怜我 不置我于死地</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:19:30.669 --> 00:19:32.087 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不然 你将会是那个…</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:19:32.171 --> 00:19:34.882 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-于死地的人！
-好快！</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:19:54.568 --> 00:19:55.819 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:19:55.903 --> 00:20:00.824 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管他的斩马刀有多大
一击不中也没关系！</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:20:01.825 --> 00:20:04.119 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然是剑心赢了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:20:09.374 --> 00:20:11.376 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>和我听说的一样厉害</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:12.961 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>怪不得成为传奇</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:20:14.421 --> 00:20:15.631 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:20:17.925 --> 00:20:19.259 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不好</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:20:19.343 --> 00:20:22.137 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们误判他的实力了</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:20:23.013 --> 00:20:28.101 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的真实实力不是用力挥斩马刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:20:28.185 --> 00:20:32.272 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>或一弹弹倒大块头的神力</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:20:32.898 --> 00:20:36.151 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他连眉心挨了寸铁都不皱下眉</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:20:36.235 --> 00:20:38.820 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他卓然超群的忍耐力才是他的实力！</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:20:38.904 --> 00:20:45.202 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>目前为止 所有敌人
都被剑心的飞天御剑流一击倒下</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:20:45.285 --> 00:20:48.580 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但对这个人却没有任何影响</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:20:52.084 --> 00:20:56.255 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真正的战斗不像决斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:20:56.338 --> 00:20:58.507 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑术高明的人不一定总能赢</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:20:59.091 --> 00:21:01.718 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还站在战场上的才是赢家！</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:21:03.011 --> 00:21:04.638 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>等你最后还站在战场上</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:21:05.264 --> 00:21:08.850 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>再说这番话吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

327
00:22:44.863 --> 00:22:48.158 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一回 《就这样多了一名伙伴》</c.simplifiedchinese>

